{"success":true,"data":{"id":507,"heading":"\u2728 \u092d\u093e\u0935\u093e\u092e\u0943\u0924\u092e\u094d: The Grand Celebration | DPS Eldeco Annual Concert 2026 \u2728","content":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\">In an evening where art transcended performance and emotions found their voice, Delhi Public School, Eldeco, presented its Annual Concert, &ldquo;Encore 2026: Bhava-Amritam &ndash; Nectar of Emotions&rdquo;, in a spectacular celebration of the human spirit. Far more than a conventional school concert, the production unfolded as an immersive artistic journey through the Navarasas, the nine fundamental emotions that shape the human experience.<\/p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph;\">The occasion was graced by Shri Vishnu Kant Pandey, Additional State Project Director, Samagra Shiksha, Government of Uttar Pradesh; Padma Shri Dr. Vidyavindu Singh; Padma Shri Dr. Anil Kumar Rastogi. The leadership of the Superhouse Group, including Vice Chairperson Ms. Shaheena Amin, Joint Managing Director Mr. Zafarul Amin and Director Ms. Firdaus Amin, also graced the occasion. Principal Ms. Gunjan Sahni welcomed the distinguished guests and the gathering.<\/p>","gallery_type":"gallery","gallery_sub_type":{"id":1,"gallery_type":"gallery","sub_type_name":"photo_gallery","description":null,"is_active":true,"sort_order":0,"created_at":"2025-10-11T07:13:36.895000Z","updated_at":"2025-10-11T07:16:12.050000Z"},"gallery_title":"? ?????????: The Grand Celebration | DPS Eldeco Annual Concert 2026 ?","gallery_slug":"bhavamatama-the-grand-celebration-dps-eldeco-annual-concert-2026","status":"active","publish_status":"published","sort_order":0,"page_id":"1156","section_id":null,"school_id":"1","branch_id":"2","language_id":null,"description":null,"meta_title":"\u092d\u093e\u0935\u093e\u092e\u0943\u0924\u092e\u094d: The Grand Celebration | DPS Eldeco Annual Concert 2026","meta_descript